#           `exudyn.robotics.models` as a `Robot`: its kinematics and inverse kinematics without a model, a
#           trajectory of a joint space and a Cartesian motion with blending, the robot as kinematic tree with
#           the joint control and the compensation of its dynamics, and the joint coordinates measured by
#           sensors. The outputs below each cell are those of the last run.
